17:["$","p","1",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Every denial carries reason codes. Claim Adjustment Reason Codes state why the amount was reduced; Remittance Advice Remark Codes add detail. Reading them is the first step, and the code frequently names the fix directly."}]
